PATENT PENDING NOTICE:
The methods, cryptographic-geometric modulation algorithms, 54-marma non-linear
incidence verification mechanisms, Fermat-prime d-sequence QIM schedules,
recursive threshold Canary leak-tracing channels, and optical screen-photo
error-correction systems implemented in this repository are the subject of
20-year Ukrainian Invention Patent Application No. a 2026 06266 (Incoming No.
Вх-72320/2026; priority/filing date 2026-10-19 officially established by
UKRNOIVI Decision No. 24741/ЗА/26 on 2026-10-29 under Art. 13 of the Law of
Ukraine No. 3687-XII, IPC G06F 21/64, H04L 9/32, G06T 1/00) and corresponding
international priority filings under the Paris Convention and Patent
Cooperation Treaty (PCT). All patent rights are strictly reserved by the
Inventor, Yaroslav V. Baienko.

