--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2. GRANT OF ACADEMIC, EVALUATION & PUBLIC VERIFICATION LICENSE (ROYALTY-FREE)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Subject to the restrictions in Section 3 and Section 4, the Licensor hereby
grants You a worldwide, non-exclusive, royalty-free, revocable license to:

  2.1. Public Document Verification (Tier 1 Verifier): Use the client-side
       browser verifier and CLI verification commands (`verify`, `selftest`,
       `doctor`) to verify the cryptographic authenticity and geometric
       integrity of documents already sealed with the Marma-Crypto Protocol.
  2.2. Scientific Peer Review & Academic Reproducibility: Execute, inspect, and
       benchmark the source code and automated test suites (`tests/`) solely
       for academic peer review (including IEEE, IACR, Elsevier, and SSRN
       review processes), university teaching, and non-commercial scientific
       research, provided that any resulting academic publication cites the
       Author's canonical papers (DOI: 10.5281/zenodo.23429017 and
       DOI: 10.2139/ssrn.7631458).
  2.3. Personal Non-Commercial Evaluation: Test the interactive browser studio
       and CLI in a non-production sandbox environment to evaluate the
       protocol for potential commercial licensing.

